    description: Some("An underwater shooter in which the player\'s fish blasts bubbles at the guard fish ringing each of five boss monsters — downed guards drop as fruit to be gobbled up before they revert to enemies. A power gauge drains steadily, so every boss must be reached and beaten before it empties, with a sonar sweep to hunt them down and a brief recharge each time a ring is cleared."),
